# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supervisor — OPTIONAL local overrides (TEMPLATE)
#
# A .env here is NOT required to deploy: every value defaults from
# demo-environment.yaml + agents/runtime-manifest.yaml (engine_env + this
# agent's env: block). Create one only to OVERRIDE something for an
# experiment. NO SECRETS BELONG IN THIS FILE for deploys — the Apigee key is
# a Secret Manager reference (APIGEE_API_KEY_SECRET, defaulted from the
# manifest). Plaintext APIGEE_API_KEY= is for LOCAL RUNS ONLY and is exactly
# why real .env files stay gitignored.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.1-pro-preview     # try a bigger model
# DISPLAY_NAME=a2a-supervisor-agent          # engine display name (manifest default)
# APIGEE_API_KEY_SECRET=apigee-key-supervisor         # Secret Manager secret (manifest default)
# APIGEE_LLM_PROXY_URL=https://internal.apigee.com/aiplatform
# APIGEE_MCP_URL=https://internal.apigee.com/mcp
# ACL_ENABLED=0                          # disable the per-user ACL
# SUBAGENT_ALLOWLIST=order_agent,...     # attachment policy override
# PROJECT_ID / REGION / STAGING_BUCKET / AGENT_RUNNER_SA / PSC_* also
# default from the manifests; uncommenting any of these overrides.
